  "body": "[As it is currently specified](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/forms.html#context-menus), it is not possible to use more than one `<menu>` to add things to a single elements' context menu. This could be a problem if - for example - one was to use two JavaScript libraries which both added something to the context menu of the same element. Only one of the additions would be displayed.",
